    - Save {0} coins and purchase the next conveyor upgrade.
  - Key: UI/Tutorial/Step/upgrade_first_conveyor/Touch
    Translations:
    - "\u041D\u0430\u043A\u043E\u043F\u0438 {0} \u043C\u043E\u043D\u0435\u0442 \u0438
