      ({1}/{0})."
    - Save {0} coins for the cheapest territory ({1}/{0}).
  - Key: UI/Tutorial/Context/EquipHammer
    Translations:
    - "\u0412\u044B\u0431\u0435\u0440\u0438 \u043C\u043E\u043B\u043E\u0442, \u0447\u0442\u043E\u0431\u044B
